WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.120
The country was still recovering from the aftermath

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.240
ten years after the end of the Great Tokyo War.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.510
Most of the country's leaders, ruling class, and wealthy

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.720
had vanished into thin air.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.700
Japan's ten or so newly reorganized states

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.100
divided themselves up into the old prefectures again.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.360
Then stuff happened, and they became independent!

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:37.140
Each region embraced their unique colors, developed at an alarming rate,

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.860
and began to avoid contact with others.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.120
But it did not last!

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.620
Peace in the new age was soon disrupted

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:50.760
as countless seeds of unrest began to sprout.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:57.210
Those that inherited the strong sense of community from ages past

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:02.800
began to show their exclusivity and selfishness.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:10.020
Vigilantes opened up the world forcefully, and became protectors of peace.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:13.580
Now, they've returned to their double-edged roots,

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:17.100
to hack and slash in your hometown!

