00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:00.670
The moonlight stone!

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:02.320
You still have that?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:05.680
Of course. It's my good luck charm.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.560
Thank you for all your hard work.

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.100
